; ＠備考◆焦燥感・苦しい

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:亚里沙<br>喝的安眠药，<br>是那种过量服用<br>【也不会当场死亡】的药物……|#0104Trial11_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我说得没错吧，<br>梅露露。|#0104Trial11_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:是、是的……<br>安眠药毕竟不是剧毒，<br>喝了也不会<br>令人当场死亡……|#0104Trial11_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……那么，<br>昨晚亚里沙<br>在喝药之后，<br>应该也没有<br>立即死亡才对。|#0104Trial11_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……然后昨晚<br>艾玛在地下进行了<br>移动处刑台的操作，没错吧？|#0104Trial11_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR5,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Fearful_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:等、等一下……！<br>现在还没弄清楚<br>我按下的按钮<br>到底是不是<br>处刑台的操作按钮吧……！|#0104Trial11_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果你操作过<br>地下的控制面板的话，<br>那应该就是按过了。|#0104Trial11_Warden001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因为处刑台的升降按钮<br>就安装在<br>随手就能按下的位置。|#0104Trial11_Warden002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:并且昨晚<br>处刑台<br>只升降过一次。<br>……这点可以从历史记录<br>得到确认。|#0104Trial11_Warden003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01,Angle01/Facial/Pale>Pale01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那、<br>那就是说……<br>由于艾玛亲的操作，<br>睡着的亚里沙<br>被关到<br>地下了……！？|#0104Trial11_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆沈んだ表情・悔しげ

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Pale>Pale01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果……<br>真是这样……<br>那把亚里沙<br>活活冻死的<br>凶手就是……|#0104Trial11_Margo005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_04_11_01\">樱羽艾玛</link>……<br>凶手就是你。|#0104Trial11_Margo006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


